From 4f97a1bfe355207ba5f2103be7649a2aa65ef3cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chase Payne <chase_payne@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 11:11:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(driver): prove terminal-session HDR transport

Add session-scoped HDR control and Update2/CommitModes2 telemetry so the remote IDD can exercise real advanced-color transitions. Add public HDR state probes and a deterministic HDR10 renderer with source and composed-frame captures to distinguish application submission from IddCx transport. The proof tools expose when Windows accepts HDR configuration but the remote-session kernel path still commits SDR BGRA8 frames.

